## Key conventions

- **CMS:** All Dato in `packages/service-dato`. Getters in `src/handlers/`. GQL in `src/gql/*.gql.ts`. Types in `types-dato.ts` (codegen).
- **App alias:** `@rotate/cms` → `packages/service-dato/src/index.ts`.
- **Design system:** Tailwind v4 with `@theme` and `@utility`. Uses `@source` to scan `apps/website` and `devtools` for class usage.
- **Layout:** `BaseLayout.astro` in website — binds composition, imports design-system and devtools. Layout stays in website; core UI in `packages/ui`.

## packages/ui vs apps/website

| Layer | Location | Responsibility |
|-------|----------|----------------|
| Core UI | `packages/ui` | Buttons, inputs, NavLink, cards, etc. Grouped by domain. No app logic, no CMS. |
| Layout, containers, modules | `apps/website` | Logic binding only. Layout binds composition; containers fetch; modules compose from packages/ui. Follows behaviour-escalation. |

